    "modifier_medusa_11_0": "New Passive Ability: Cold Blooded \n\n Each time the hero is targeted by a spell, she releases a Mystic Snake at the attacker that only affects the aggressor. \n\n Cooldown: 24/18/12 sec.",
    "modifier_medusa_11_1": "New Passive Ability: <b><font color='#eabe10'>Cold Blooded</font></b> \n\n Each time the hero is targeted by a spell, she releases a Mystic Snake at the attacker that only affects the aggressor. \n\n Cooldown: <b><font color='#eabe10'>24</font></b>/18/12 sec.",
    "modifier_medusa_11_2": "New Passive Ability: <b><font color='#eabe10'>Cold Blooded</font></b> \n\n Each time the hero is targeted by a spell, she releases a Mystic Snake at the attacker that only affects the aggressor. \n\n Cooldown: 24/<b><font color='#eabe10'>18</font></b>/12 sec.",
